---
const photo = "https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/062c0b4d-4942-4e3d-969c-8c0bb1258d9b.png";
---

<section class="py-20 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 items-stretch">

    <!-- Left: photo -->
    <div class="h-64 sm:h-80 md:h-auto min-h-0 order-1">
      <img
        src={photo}
        alt="Book Printing"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Right: text -->
    <div class="bg-[rgba(217,217,217,0.1)] flex flex-col justify-center px-6 sm:px-8 md:px-10 py-10 sm:py-12 order-2">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase leading-snug text-black mb-3 sm:mb-4">
        HEARST Book Studio A Leading Book Printing Company
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#555] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
        At HearEst Book Studio, we deliver premium book printing that brings your
        vision to life with stunning clarity and lasting quality. Whether you need
        a short print run for a local launch or thousands of copies for national
        distribution, our state-of-the-art printing facilities ensure every page
        and every cover looks exactly as you imagined it.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#555] text-sm leading-relaxed">
        We offer a full range of printing options — paperback, hardcover, full
        colour, black and white, and print-on-demand — so you only ever pay for
        what you need. Our team handles paper selection, binding, lamination, and
        quality control from start to finish, giving you a finished product you
        can be truly proud of.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-10">
  <p class="text-[#555] text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
    The physical quality of your book makes a lasting first impression on every reader who picks it up.
    HearEst Book Studio partners with premium printing facilities to deliver sharp text, vibrant cover
    colours, and durable binding that stands the test of time. From selecting the right paper weight to
    choosing between gloss and matte lamination, we guide you through every decision so your printed
    book reflects the same care and craft you poured into writing it.
  </p>
</div>
